{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31318","headline":"喷玉泉冥会诗八首 白衣叟述甘棠馆西楹诗 · 李玖","name":"喷玉泉冥会诗八首 白衣叟述甘棠馆西楹诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浮云凄惨日微明，沈痛将军负罪名。\n白昼叫阍无近戚，缟衣饮气只门生。\n佳人暗泣填宫泪，廐马连嘶换主声。\n六合茫茫皆汉土，此身无处哭田横。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李玖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31318.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31318","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}